### Execute API at 8080, ERP at 8081 and PostgreSQL at 5434.
@api = http://localhost:8080

### Create a pending order (201); repeat to verify conflict (409).
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId":"DEMO-001","customerName":"Cliente demonstração","totalValue":125.50}

### Create a deterministic ERP failure.
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId":"FAIL-DEMO-001","customerName":"Cliente demonstração","totalValue":25.00}

### Process pending orders and wait for the batch summary.
POST {{api}}/orders/process

### Inspect status, attempt count and sanitized last error.
GET {{api}}/orders
